# Internal QA artefacts — this repository is PUBLIC.
#
# The coverage ledger and the tier test-case files describe, in detail, defects
# that are filed and in several cases still UNFIXED — an unauthenticated upload,
# an auth bypass, an invoice token that is an unsalted hash of public values.
# Publishing that here would hand over working exploit notes for live bugs.
#
# The harness reports are raw dumps of every screen, field and route, and the
# handover notes are internal working context. None of it is needed to RUN the
# suite; all of it is kept locally and shared through the QA workspace instead.
test-cases/
harness/report/
HANDOFF.md
harness/screenshots/
